<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<strong>Elevator pitch:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>• SCP-xxxx is a working compass, observation outside the area of 200m radius from SCP-xxxx on the area within will result as if there is currently no SCP-xxxx and sapient being (having intelligence at least equal to lizards) inside the area. Observers from inside will perceive white fog at the border of the area which can't be seen through.<br />
• SCP-xxxx-1 is any sapient being that currently observing SCP-xxxx, other SCP-xxxx-1 or on SCP-xxxx-2<br />
• If there are about 11 to 35 SCP-xxxx-1 at the moment, SCP-xxxx might transfer all SCP-xxxx-1 along with everything thing in their sight and touch to the magnetic South Pole a planet designated as SCP-xxxx-2 in an unknown dimension. When in this area, if SCP-xxxx is destroyed or has a distance more than 10m away from all SCP-xxxx-1 and out of sight, SCP-xxxx will reappears within 10m of the closest SCP-xxxx-1.<br />
• SCP-xxxx-2 has a diameter about 1100km, its surface is made up of places in and out side our dimension, those places are constantly changing when out of observation. Interaction on SCP-xxxx-2 affect those places where they come from (a record of expedition in SCP-xxxx-2 was found in an abandoned house). The only way known to get out of SCP-xxxx-2 is to put SCP-xxxx directly on the magnetic North Pole of the planet.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>Central Narrative:</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The foundation found SCP-xxxx after many report of missing in a small town, MTF team was sent in for investigation.<br />
• Expedition 1 summary:<br />
Upon recovering SCP-xxxx, it manifested and transferred 11 researchers and the MTF team to SCP-xxxx-2. After more than 2 years, they became the first people to exit SCP-xxxx-2.<br />
After that SCP-xxxx activated several times and caused lost of many personnel but SCP-xxxx didn’t activate while they tried to test it<br />
• Expedition 2 summary:<br />
Several guards, personnel and D-class was transferred by SCP-xxxx-2, they got out with loss of most people. This expedition gave the foundation a lot of valuable information.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> I find this idea have many potential. I think that it would be interesting to see how people deal with anomolies while in other dimension, they might be some unknown anomolies or known SCP.</p>
<p><strong>Additional notes:</strong> I planned to have 4 expedition but I haven’t come up with ideas for 3rd and 4th one, I planned the 3rd to be the record left over from previous activation of SCP-xxxx</p>

